<title>USA: Tyco acquires American Tube and Pipe.</title>
<headline>Tyco acquires American Tube and Pipe.</headline>
<dateline>EXETER, N.H. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tyco International Ltd. said Wednesday it has acquired American Tube and Pipe Co Inc.</p>
<p>Tyco did not disclose the terms of the transaction.</p>
<p>American Tube has annual revenues, said Tyco, of more than $120 million annually.</p>
</text>
